","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"墨翟","kind":"person","person_id":"tjx_q6x_kc7","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p012","chapter_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"墨","kind":"person","person_id":"tjx_q6x_kc7","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji074-010","person_id":"tjx_q6x_kc7","title":"大夫","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun","source_id":"s-shiji-074-mengxun","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p012","quote":"而趙亦有公孫龍為堅白同異之辯，劇子之言；魏有李悝，盡地力之教；楚有尸子、長盧；阿之吁子焉。自如孟子至于吁子，世多有其書，故不論其傳云。蓋墨翟，宋之大夫，善守御，為節用。或曰并孔子時，或曰在其後。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji074-010:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p012","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"大夫","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0068","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授予、文獻用稱與任事分存，未知日期與終點不補；淳于髡欲以卿相位待而謝去不作已任，春申君死亡不直接作全部爵位終點。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji074-053","person_id":"tjx_q6x_kc7","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-074-mengxun"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","rationale":"依本段明示人名及局部敘事暫接，淳于髡髡先生、騶奭奭與晏嬰晏各限所述範圍；管引古不補管仲。薦髡客子稱及兩次獻馬獻謳者保留未名候選，不確證不同匿名人物。齊王命列大夫與齊宣、齊襄王分候選，未因敘事相鄰自動同指；群體之徒、之屬及學說合稱不補成員。欲以卿相待而謝去不當任官，李斯弟子不當子嗣，墨翟年代或曰異說保留。","surfaces":["墨翟"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p012","quote":"而趙亦有公孫龍為堅白同異之辯，劇子之言；魏有李悝，盡地力之教；楚有尸子、長盧；阿之吁子焉。自如孟子至于吁子，世多有其書，故不論其傳云。蓋墨翟，宋之大夫，善守御，為節用。或曰并孔子時，或曰在其後。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji112-exemplars-mo","person_ids":["tjx_q6x_kc7"],"canonical_person_id":"tjx_q6x_kc7","status":"contextual_provisional","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-112-pingjin","c-shiji-006-shihuang","c-shiji-074-mengxun"],"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p015","quote":"臣聞天下之患在於土崩，不在於瓦解，古今一也。何謂土崩？秦之末世是也。陳涉無千乘之尊，尺土之地，身非王公大人名族之后，無鄉曲之譽，非有孔、墨、曾子之賢，陶朱、猗頓之富也，然起窮巷，奮棘矜，偏袒大呼而天下從風，此其故何也？由民困而主不恤，下怨而上不知（也），俗已亂而政不修，此三者陳涉之所以為資也。是之謂土崩。故曰天下之患在於土崩。何謂瓦解？吳、楚、齊、趙之兵是也。七國謀為大逆，號皆稱萬乘之君，帶甲數十萬，威足以嚴其境內，財足以勸其士民，然不能西攘尺寸之地而身為禽於中原者，此其故何也？非權輕於匹夫而兵弱於陳涉也，當是之時，先帝之德澤未衰而安土樂俗之民眾，故諸侯無境外之助。此之謂瓦解，故曰天下之患不在瓦解。由是觀之，天下誠有土崩之勢，雖布衣窮處之士或首惡而危海內，陳涉是也。況三晉之君或存乎！天下雖未有大治也，誠能無土崩之勢，雖有彊國勁兵不得旋踵而身為禽矣，吳、楚、齊、趙是也。況群臣百姓能為亂乎哉！此二體者，安危之明要也，賢主所留意而深察也。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0068"],"text_layer":"received_chapter"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07","quote":"秦王既沒，餘威振於殊俗。陳涉，罋牖繩樞之子，甿隸之人，而遷徙之徒，才能不及中人，非有仲尼、墨翟之賢，陶朱、猗頓之富，躡足行伍之閒，而倔起什伯之中，率罷散之卒，將數百之眾，而轉攻秦。斬木為兵，揭竿為旗，天下雲集響應，贏糧而景從，山東豪俊遂并起而亡秦族矣。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0045"],"text_layer":"received_chapter"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun","source_id":"s-shiji-074-mengxun","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p012","quote":"而趙亦有公孫龍為堅白同異之辯，劇子之言；魏有李悝，盡地力之教；楚有尸子、長盧；阿之吁子焉。自如孟子至于吁子，世多有其書，故不論其傳云。蓋墨翟，宋之大夫，善守御，為節用。或曰并孔子時，或曰在其後。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0068"],"text_layer":"received_chapter"}],"rationale":"孔墨曾子之賢的墨，按始皇篇同為陳涉才能對比所稱墨翟與孟荀傳墨翟暫接；墨家群稱不由此全域標成墨翟。 原文、引古與附詔層各存；不以引用時間當人物存世或授官時間。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"identity_materialized":true}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07","text":"秦王既沒，餘威振於殊俗。陳涉，罋牖繩樞之子，甿隸之人，而遷徙之徒，才能不及中人，非有仲尼、墨翟之賢，陶朱、猗頓之富，躡足行伍之閒，而倔起什伯之中，率罷散之卒，將數百之眾，而轉攻秦。斬木為兵，揭竿為旗，天下雲集響應，贏糧而景從，山東豪俊遂并起而亡秦族矣。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"pom_ycp_ha5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"j5s_4zz_bos","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"墨翟","kind":"person","person_id":"tjx_q6x_kc7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"陶朱","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"猗頓","kind":"person","person_id":"kxz_6nu_h9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"秦族","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、群體或未核指代，不據引文譬喻補造個人。"}],"source_block_kind":"witness_dd","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p012","text":"而趙亦有公孫龍為堅白同異之辯，劇子之言；魏有李悝，盡地力之教；楚有尸子、長盧；阿之吁子焉。自如孟子至于吁子，世多有其書，故不論其傳云。蓋墨翟，宋之大夫，善守御，為節用。或曰并孔子時，或曰在其後。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"公孫龍","kind":"person","person_id":"5l5_0v4_gqg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"劇子","kind":"person","person_id":"lg2_cqw_2hr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"李悝","kind":"person","person_id":"wyx_6d2_xxp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"尸子","kind":"person","person_id":"b4v_jbu_4sr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"長盧","kind":"person","person_id":"fx4_ybu_7b9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"吁子","kind":"person","person_id":"3nq_r49_oo5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"孟子","kind":"person","person_id":"saz_old_5fi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"吁子","kind":"person","person_id":"3nq_r49_oo5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"墨翟","kind":"person","person_id":"tjx_q6x_kc7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"或曰","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、族屬、學說合稱或匿名說話者保持未定；不將黃老儒墨自動拆為人名，也不補群體成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m012-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"或曰","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、族屬、學說合稱或匿名說話者保持未定；不將黃老儒墨自動拆為人名，也不補群體成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun","book_id":"b-shiji-074","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-074-mengxun"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p015","text":"臣聞天下之患在於土崩，不在於瓦解，古今一也。何謂土崩？秦之末世是也。陳涉無千乘之尊，尺土之地，身非王公大人名族之后，無鄉曲之譽，非有孔、墨、曾子之賢，陶朱、猗頓之富也，然起窮巷，奮棘矜，偏袒大呼而天下從風，此其故何也？由民困而主不恤，下怨而上不知（也），俗已亂而政不修，此三者陳涉之所以為資也。是之謂土崩。故曰天下之患在於土崩。何謂瓦解？吳、楚、齊、趙之兵是也。七國謀為大逆，號皆稱萬乘之君，帶甲數十萬，威足以嚴其境內，財足以勸其士民，然不能西攘尺寸之地而身為禽於中原者，此其故何也？非權輕於匹夫而兵弱於陳涉也，當是之時，先帝之德澤未衰而安土樂俗之民眾，故諸侯無境外之助。此之謂瓦解，故曰天下之患不在瓦解。由是觀之，天下誠有土崩之勢，雖布衣窮處之士或首惡而危海內，陳涉是也。況三晉之君或存乎！天下雖未有大治也，誠能無土崩之勢，雖有彊國勁兵不得旋踵而身為禽矣，吳、楚、齊、趙是也。況群臣百姓能為亂乎哉！此二體者，安危之明要也，賢主所留意而深察也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"pom_ycp_ha5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"孔","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"墨","kind":"person","person_id":"tjx_q6x_kc7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"曾子","kind":"person","person_id":"c7w_nyj_95u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"陶朱","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"猗頓","kind":"person","person_id":"kxz_6nu_h9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0138","start":138,"end":140,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"pom_ycp_ha5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0181","start":181,"end":183,"surface":"七國","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0252","start":252,"end":254,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"pom_ycp_ha5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0261","start":261,"end":263,"surface":"先帝","kind":"person","person_id":"moo_r04_tz1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0332","start":332,"end":334,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"pom_ycp_ha5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0338","start":338,"end":342,"surface":"三晉之君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","book_id":"b-shiji-112","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin"}],"sources":[{"chapter